              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "eksoh"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe is easy and delicious! I tried this with leftover ham and it was great. I made some minor modifications to accomodate what I had on hand and I served it over egg noodles with a side salad. Instead of fresh tomato, I used a can of diced tomatoes; instead of croutons, I used crumbled ritz crackers; and I just used regular mayonnaise."
